  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Iwebiye Kpakpata MPCS Cassava Processing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Iwebiye Kpakpata Cooperative Society Limited (IKCSL) is a cooperative society wholly owned by a group of small-scale low-income cassava producers located at Gberiji-Kutara village, in Abaji Area Council of the Federal Capital Territory. The Cooperatives members cultivate cassava on individual plots and collectively on a 5-hectare farm. IKCSL cultivates and processes cassava into garri.</narrative>
  </description>
